        "text": "We believe the future is for everyone. That’s why Meta is partnering with CNIB – a non-profit founded in 1918 that empowers Canadians impacted by blindness to live their dreams – to help bring the benefit of AI glasses to more Canadians who are blind, Deafblind or have low vision. The goal of the pa",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
