      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Future Is for Everyone: Meta and CNIB Partner to Support Canadians Who Are Blind, Deafblind or Have Low Vision",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta is partnering with CNIB to bring the expertise and lived experience of Canadians who are blind, Deafblind or have low vision directly into the future of wearable technology.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With funding from Meta, CNIB will lead community listening, peer-led demonstrations and training, and provide feedback to Meta’s accessibility and product teams.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta is also donating AI glasses through CNIB’s Come to Work program, to help participants explore how wearable technology can support employment opportunities.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That’s why Meta is partnering with CNIB – a non-profit founded in 1918 that empowers Canadians impacted by blindness to live their dreams – to help bring the benefit of AI glasses to more Canadians who are blind, Deafblind or have low vision.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The goal of the partnership is to help people who are blind, Deafblind or have low vision explore the possibilities of AI wearable technology, and draw on the knowledge, expertise and lived experience of the community to shape a more accessible future.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Supporting community champions: Supporting Canadians who are blind, Deafblind or have low vision to lead in-person peer training and demonstrations, and gather candid product feedback in their communities.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "But for people who are blind or have low vision, the difference they make can be life-changing — helping with everyday tasks like reading text, identifying objects and describing the world around them, and helping people live more independently.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This partnership builds on our work with blind and low vision communities around the world, including donating Ray-Ban Meta glasses to every blind veteran in America in partnership with the Blinded Veterans Association, and our work with Vision Ireland .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“People who are blind, Deafblind or have low vision bring valuable expertise about where barriers remain and how tools like AI glasses can offer greater choice, freedom and independence in everyday life.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Partnerships like this one get Meta’s AI glasses to more blind, Deafblind and low-vision Canadians at work and in their daily lives.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Working directly with CNIB and its community—the people who use the glasses every day—helps us build better products for everyone,” said Maxine Williams, VP of Accessibility, Meta.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/the-future-is-for-everyone-meta-and-cnib-partner-to-support-canadians-who-are-blind-deafblind-or-have-low-vision/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-29T17:00:36.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T01:55:00.715Z"
      }
